## Install

Copy this file to `.cursor/rules/framestorm-and-solve.mdc` and place the two playbooks at:

- `playbooks/Framestorming-Playbook.md`
- `playbooks/Solving-Playbook.md`

relative to the project root. If you prefer a different folder name, update the paths in the table at the top of this rule to match.
